# Paxx Environment Variables Template

# This file contains all environment variables needed for the project.
# Copy the appropriate variables to .env files in frontend/ and backend/

## Frontend Variables (frontend/.env.local)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3001

## Backend Variables (backend/.env)
# FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
# PORT=3001
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/paxx
# ENCRYPTION_KEY=your-very-secure-encryption-key-here
# JWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-here
# NODE_ENV=development
